  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHK framework agreement</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHK ramavtal 2000</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework agreement Swedish Helsinki Committee. 54 projects plus 3 815 000 SEK for future programmes, totally 25.5 MSEK (application for 26.1 MSEK). Most of the projects concern independent media, many in Serbia, but there are also pure hr and cultural projects.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramavtal SHK &#xe5;r 2000. 54 projekt plus 3 815 000 f&#xf6;r tillkommande insatser, totalt 25,5 MSEK (urspr. ans&#xf6;kan 26,1 MSEK). De flesta projekt r&#xf6;r media, mycket i Serbien, men &#xe4;ven rena MR- och kultur- projekt finns med.</narrative>
  </description>
